<title>HONG KONG: Hang Lung seen seeking HK$4.8 bln loan.</title>
<headline>Hang Lung seen seeking HK$4.8 bln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hang Lung Development Co is seeking HK$4.8 billion in financing through a loan facility, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said the facility is expected to have a final maturity of five years.</p>
<p>Proceeds are to be partially used for refinancing previous debts, bankers said.</p>
<p>Hang Lung Development declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
